goloops
=======

The in-process loop in src/goloops/loop.py is adapted from waku-agent
(ShenSeanChen/waku-agent, MIT), specifically waku/loop/agent.py — the file
whose docstring ends "This file is the whole trick."

The DAG walk (waves of concurrent [P] nodes, serial otherwise, cycle detect)
follows the scheduler shape described for sipyourdrink-ltd/bernstein
(Apache-2.0). This repo does not vendor bernstein.

Worktree merge-or-abort (dry-run, never leave a half-merge) follows the
safety contract of nekocode/agent-worktree (MIT). This repo does not vendor
agent-worktree; `goloops doctor` will use `wt` when it is on PATH.

Memory commands shell out to gastownhall/beads (`bd`) when present.

The ten-slot map (G1–G4, L1–L6) is the article's inventory, not a claim
that those projects are bundled here. Install only the slots you will use.
